# --- Secrets (CLAUDE.md §1.2) ----------------------------------------------
# appsettings.json IS committed: it holds placeholder keys only, so the team
# knows what to populate. Environment-specific files carry real connection
# strings / SAP Service Layer credentials and must never be committed.
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
*.secrets.json
secrets.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

